[h2]About TLB MilSim[/h2]
We are a MilSim unit, and this mod was built mainly for our own operations. We are sharing it with the rest of the community in case it is useful to anyone else, and because we would like to hear suggestions and ideas for improvements.

If you have one, or you hit a problem, come and tell us on our Discord.

[url=https://discord.gg/TLBMilSim]discord.gg/TLBMilSim[/url]

